---
title: "Hopscotch Island | New Horizons"
layout: base.njk
permalink: /shrines/animalcrossing/newhorizons/
customcss: '/assets/css/acnh/hopscotch.css'
---

<main class="hs-shell hs-home">
  {% include "acnh/nav.njk" %}

  <header class="hs-hero hs-hero--home">
    <div class="hs-hero__copy">
      <span class="hs-eyebrow">✿ welcome to my little island ✿</span>
      <h1>{{ acnh.island.name or "Hopscotch" }}<span class="hs-heading-flower" aria-hidden="true">✿</span></h1>
      <p class="hs-hero__lead">A pink and froggy little corner of the world. Come meet the neighbours, browse my collections and watch the island grow.</p>
      <div class="hs-pills">
        <span>🍑 {{ acnh.island.nativeFruit or 'Peaches' }}</span>
        <span>🌎 {{ acnh.island.hemisphere | capitalize }} hemisphere</span>
        {% if acnh.island.rating %}<span>⭐ {{ acnh.island.rating }}-star island</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <a class="hs-button hs-button--pink" href="/shrines/animalcrossing/newhorizons/museum/">Explore my Critterpedia <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hs-hero__art">
      <img class="hs-frog-hero-image" src="/assets/imgs/acnh/acnh-frog-collage.png" width="1080" height="607" alt="Collage of all eighteen Animal Crossing: New Horizons frog villagers" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="hs-ticker" aria-label="Island motto"><span>♡</span> welcome to hopscotch <span>✿</span> slow days, cute neighbours & plenty of frogs <span>♡</span></div>

  <section class="hs-section" aria-labelledby="hs-overview-heading">
    <div class="hs-section-title"><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">a little look around</span><h2 id="hs-overview-heading">Island highlights</h2></div><span class="hs-section-title__decoration">✿ ✿ ✿</span></div>
    <div class="hs-highlight-grid">
      <article class="hs-panel hs-highlight hs-highlight--mint">
        <div class="hs-highlight__icon">🐟</div>
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Blathers' museum</span>
        <h3>Critterpedia</h3>
        <p class="hs-highlight__number"><strong id="acnhTotalCaught">–</strong><small>/ 200 critters caught</small></p>
        <div class="hs-progress"><span id="acnhMuseumBar" style="width:0%"></span></div>
        <p class="hs-subnote">🐟 <b id="acnhFishCaught">–</b>/80 · 🦋 <b id="acnhBugsCaught">–</b>/80 · 🤿 <b id="acnhSeaCaught">–</b>/40</p>
        <a class="hs-text-link" href="/shrines/animalcrossing/newhorizons/museum/">See the whole collection <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="hs-panel hs-highlight hs-highlight--pink">
        <div class="hs-highlight__icon">🐸</div>
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">little faces I love</span>
        <h3>Neighbours</h3>
        <p class="hs-highlight__number"><strong>{{ acnh.villagers.current | length }}</strong><small>/ 10 plots filled</small></p>
        <p>Current villagers, old friends and a very important Frog Pond project.</p>
        <a class="hs-text-link" href="/shrines/animalcrossing/newhorizons/residents/">Meet everybody <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="hs-panel hs-highlight hs-highlight--butter">
        <div class="hs-highlight__icon">📓</div>
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">dear diary</span>
        <h3>Little memories</h3>
        {% if acnh.diary and acnh.diary.length %}
          <p class="hs-highlight__date">{{ acnh.diary[0].date }}</p>
          <p><strong>{{ acnh.diary[0].title }}</strong></p>
          <p>{{ acnh.diary[0].summary }}</p>
        {% else %}<p>Every lovely little memory starts somewhere.</p>{% endif %}
        <a class="hs-text-link" href="/shrines/animalcrossing/newhorizons/diary/">Read the scrapbook <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hs-collection-teaser hs-panel" aria-labelledby="hs-collection-teaser-title">
    <div class="hs-collection-teaser__icon" aria-hidden="true">🎀</div>
    <div><span class="hs-eyebrow">the little collector in me</span><h2 id="hs-collection-teaser-title">My collection corner</h2><p>Nook Shopping treasures, handmade DIYs, happy reactions and K.K. favourites—just the highlights, no endless inventory.</p></div>
    <a class="hs-button hs-button--pink" href="/shrines/animalcrossing/newhorizons/collections/">Browse collections ↗</a>
  </section>

  <section class="hs-section hs-two-up" aria-label="More about the island">
    <article class="hs-panel hs-about-card">
      <div class="hs-section-title"><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">my island passport</span><h2>About Hopscotch</h2></div><span aria-hidden="true">🍑</span></div>
      <dl class="hs-passport">
        <div><dt>Resident rep</dt><dd>{{ acnh.island.representative or 'Violet' }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Established</dt><dd>{{ acnh.island.started or '2025' }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Island theme</dt><dd>{{ acnh.island.theme or 'Frogs & pink' }}</dd></div>
        {% if acnh.island.ordinance %}<div><dt>Ordinance</dt><dd>{{ acnh.island.ordinance }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
        {% if acnh.island.dreamAddress %}<div><dt>Dream address</dt><dd>{{ acnh.island.dreamAddress }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
      </dl>
    </article>
    <article class="hs-panel hs-goals-card">
      <div class="hs-section-title"><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">things to do someday</span><h2>Island wishes</h2></div><span aria-hidden="true">🌱</span></div>
      {% if acnh.island.currentGoals and acnh.island.currentGoals.length %}
        <ul class="hs-goal-list">{% for goal in acnh.island.currentGoals %}<li><span aria-hidden="true">♡</span>{{ goal }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      {% else %}<p>Just enjoying island life for now!</p>{% endif %}
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="hs-tour-teaser"><span aria-hidden="true" class="hs-tour-teaser__icon">🏡</span><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">an island in progress</span><h2>Take the scenic route</h2><p>My favourite corners, builds and future little hideaways, all collected in one place.</p></div><a class="hs-button" href="/shrines/animalcrossing/newhorizons/island-tour/">Island tour ↗</a></section>
  <footer class="hs-footer">✿ thanks for visiting hopscotch · ribbit! ✿</footer>
</main>
<script id="acnh-progress-data" type="application/json">{{ acnh.museumProgress | dump | safe }}</script>
<script src="/assets/js/acnh-home.js" defer></script>
